     1,
     "\r\n  \r\n    \r\n  \r\n  <div>\r\n    <p>Dear Fathur,</p>\r\n    <p>From the error message, it seems that you need to install Rtools\r\n      [1] if you are using R on Windows.</p>\r\n    <p>You can also try the installation method from [2]. This is just\r\n      running the following lines in R:</p>\r\n    <figure>\r\n      <pre><code><span>source</span><span>(</span><span><a href=\"http://famuvie.github.io/breedR/src/setup_repo.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://famuvie.github.io/breedR/src/setup_repo.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw13yFBNqjAOIckF22ezsYa2\">&quot;http://famuvie.github.io/breedR/src/setup_repo.R&quot;</a></span><span>)</span><span>\r\ninstall.packages</span><span>(</span><span>&#39;breedR&#39;</span><span>)</span></code></pre>\r\n      <figure></figure>\r\n      <pre><code><span></span></code></pre>\r\n    </figure>\r\n    <p></p>\r\n    <p>But you probably still need to install Rtools.</p>\r\n    <p>Let me know if that works.</p>\r\n    <p>Best,</p>\r\n    <p>ƒacu.-</p>\r\n    <p><br>\r\n    </p>\r\n    <p>[1] <a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0CuMa2E9Zu855AGMRK2FXO\">https://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/Rtools/</a></p>\r\n    <p>[2] <a href=\"https://famuvie.github.io/breedR/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://famuvie.github.io/breedR/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244697505000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3_gACC4PbOfMZ-08QCqTyF\">https://famuvie.github.io/breedR/</a><br>\r\n    </p></div>"
